// "Each round the imagined threat gnaws at their thoughts" reuses the
// Bleeding health-change-over-time buff purely for its damage-over-time
// shape -- the same damage_kind-agnostic reuse hemorrhage.ron already
// established (Bleeding + damage_kind: Necrotic there; Bleeding +
// damage_kind: Psychic here -- Bleeding's own effects() never reads
// damage_kind, see common/src/comp/buff.rs). strength/dur_secs calibrated
// against every other shipped Bleeding grant (bow/sword/hemomancy siblings):
// all of them scale strength off the hit via DamageFraction rather than a
// flat Value, and keep dur_secs in the 5-12s band; this now matches both
// (a flat Value(3.0)/dur_secs(60) first draft was a real balance outlier --
// roughly hemorrhage.ron's total drain from a plain no-cooldown bolt).
BasicRanged(
    energy_cost: 50.0,
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    projectile: (
        kind: Simple,
        attack: Some((
            damage: 8,
            buff: Some((
                kind: Bleeding,
                dur_secs: 10,
                strength: DamageFraction(0.4),
                chance: 1.0,
            )),
            damage_kind: Psychic,
        )),
    ),
    projectile_body: Object(BoltFire),
    projectile_speed: 55.0,
    num_projectiles: Value(1),
    meta: (
        school: Some(Illusion),
        source: Some(Arcane),
        // level 2 spell -> min_level 12, the `level * 6` convention (see
        // sleep.ron).
        requirements: (min_level: Some(12)),
    ),
)
